{"title":"Grave Rivet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Virikh, Virikh Templar</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>A <b>gear-line reagent</b>: a <b>catalyst</b> when crafting <b>plate armor and tools</b>, making superior and flawless come up more often. One reagent lasts <b>10 crafts</b>; a failed craft uses none.</p><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Skeleton</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/drowned-crewman\">Drowned Crewman</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/stoneborn\">Stoneborn</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">Virikh Lord</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">Virikh Dragonslayer</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 3 of 191 looted corpses (1/64)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/64<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - dropped it in 3 of 200 looted corpses (1/67)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/67<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"grave-rivet\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/d3bf2a9071ade7fa858b.svg\" alt=\"Grave Rivet\"></div><h3>Grave Rivet</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/29/2026, 7:33:38 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}